WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.099
This ten-question formative test is separate from ungraded practice

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.533
The pass mark is eighty percent You have three

00:00:08.599 --> 00:00:12.178
total submissions per question and two total quiz attempts

00:00:13.099 --> 00:00:17.047
There are no penalties or partial marks After a

00:00:17.047 --> 00:00:21.152
failed first quiz complete relevant teaching review and practice

00:00:21.205 --> 00:00:25.389
before the one permitted retry Answer keys are withheld

00:00:25.468 --> 00:00:29.363
until the quiz has reached its final outcome This

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:32.284
browser test is not an authenticated grade or a

00:00:32.310 --> 00:00:33.731
final examination
